  "_previous_source": [
    "All five leaderboards transcribed from the admin's June 2026 GymRats",
    "screenshots -- 'Mês passado' for the month slice, 'Este ano' for the year",
    "slice. No placeholders left.",
    "",
    "Durations are normalised to minutes: '33 hr 53 min' -> 2033.",
    "",
    "Every list is cut off by the phone screen at the bottom, so people on 0",
    "may be missing. It does not affect the tally -- they are excluded on zero",
    "hustle -- but the year tables are incomplete for Andressa, William, Paula",
    "and Thamyres, who fall below the fold. Worth re-shooting if a future",
    "season tiebreak reaches them.",
    "",
    "Rayza's hustle value is inferred from her 11th-place badge next to Paula",
    "on 0; the number itself is cut off. She is excluded either way."
